# Intentionally empty — the WO-W08 soft completion gate.
#
# Recorded mock-session transcripts land here once WO-W03's session
# graph merges and a scenario can be replayed through it under
# `use_mock_data=true` with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=local-preview-disabled.
# The exact completion condition is in ../manifest.json under the
# `recorded_mock_session_transcripts` entry.
